title: "stablecoin-tbills-genius-act: stablecoin flows and US Treasury-bill yields after the GENIUS Act"
abstract: >-
  Pre-registered local projections of the association between stablecoin
  flows and US Treasury-bill yields before and after the GENIUS Act
  (Public Law 119-27). Open data (DefiLlama, FRED, Binance), fully
  reproducible with `make all`.
